",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813876323\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813876323\",\"name\":\"Can digital marketing be done part-time?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Many freelancers and small business owners do digital marketing part-time. You can start with flexible hours and scale up as you gain experience.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813892273\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813892273\",\"name\":\"Can digital marketing help local businesses?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. Local shops, restaurants, gyms, or salons use Google Maps listings, social media, and WhatsApp marketing to attract nearby customers.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813907232\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813907232\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between inbound and outbound marketing?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Inbound marketing attracts customers through valuable content (blogs, SEO, videos), while outbound marketing pushes ads directly to people (TV, radio, banner ads).\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813930390\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813930390\",\"name\":\"Can digital marketing replace traditional marketing completely?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not entirely. While digital is dominant, traditional methods like TV ads or billboards still work in some industries. The best results come from a mix of both.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813941477\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813941477\",\"name\":\"What skills are most important in digital marketing?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Creativity, communication, basic analytics, writing, and adaptability are key. Technical tools can be learned later, but soft skills build a strong foundation.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813950852\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813950852\",\"name\":\"Is digital marketing suitable for introverts?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Many roles like SEO, content writing, analytics, or email marketing don\u2019t require constant interaction. Introverts can thrive in these areas.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813970719\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813970719\",\"name\":\"How do freelancers get clients in digital marketing?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"By showcasing their skills 