,{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813876323","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813876323","name":"Can digital marketing be done part-time?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many freelancers and small business owners do digital marketing part-time. You can start with flexible hours and scale up as you gain experience.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813892273","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813892273","name":"Can digital marketing help local businesses?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Local shops, restaurants, gyms, or salons use Google Maps listings, social media, and WhatsApp marketing to attract nearby customers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813907232","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813907232","name":"What is the difference between inbound and outbound marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Inbound marketing attracts customers through valuable content (blogs, SEO, videos), while outbound marketing pushes ads directly to people (TV, radio, banner ads).","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813930390","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813930390","name":"Can digital marketing replace traditional marketing completely?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not entirely. While digital is dominant, traditional methods like TV ads or billboards still work in some industries. The best results come from a mix of both.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813941477","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813941477","name":"What skills are most important in digital marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Creativity, communication, basic analytics, writing, and adaptability are key. Technical tools can be learned later, but soft skills build a strong foundation.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813950852","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813950852","name":"Is digital marketing suitable for introverts?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many roles like SEO, content writing, analytics, or email marketing don\u2019t require constant interaction. Introverts can thrive in these areas.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813970719","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813970719","name":"How do freelancers get clients in digital marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"By showcasing their skills on LinkedIn, freelancing platforms like Upwork\/Fiverr, or building personal websites with case studies and results.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813986580","position":11,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813986580","name":"Does digital marketing work for B2B businesses?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. B2B companies use LinkedIn, email campaigns, and SEO to generate leads and reach decision-makers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813996207","position":12,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759813996207","name":"How does digital marketing help in personal branding?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It allows individuals to share expertise on LinkedIn, YouTube, or Instagram, building credibility and attracting opportunities like jobs or collaborations.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759814018065","position":13,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759814018065","name":"What is remarketing in digital marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Remarketing shows ads to people who visited your site but didn\u2019t buy. For example, seeing ads for the same shoes you checked online.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759814025953","position":14,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1759814025953","name":"Can I earn money with digital marketing without a job?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You can freelance, start affiliate marketing, build blogs, or create YouTube channels. Many digital marketers earn independently.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/